abstract: >-
  An interactive Google Colab notebook for segmentation and quantitative
  analysis of multiplex immunofluorescence and chromogenic
  immunohistochemistry images. The fluorescence workflow supports image
  import, z-stack projection, nuclear or expanded-cell segmentation,
  per-cell intensity and morphology measurement, marker classification,
  visualization, and tabular export. The chromogenic workflow supports
  H-DAB or user-defined colour deconvolution, cell-based H-scoring,
  area-based scoring, optional negative-control calibration, threshold
  review, visualization, and export.

keywords:
  - multiplex immunofluorescence
  - chromogenic immunohistochemistry
  - image segmentation
  - Cellpose
  - Segment Anything for Microscopy
  - Google Colab
  - colour deconvolution
  - H-score
  - stained area fraction
  - negative control
  - HER2
  - Human Protein Atlas
  - reproducible image analysis
